(text "The DevKit plugs into two 22-pin sockets, rows 25.4 mm (1.0 in) apart: one footprint, J1 = pads 1-22, J3 = pads 23-44." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 87f28e10-1f6f-462a-bf50-0d9287b64d4c))
(text "Its own 3V3 pins are left open: the board makes +3V3 separately. The N32R16V variant fits and works the same way." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ba8d7ec0-1a74-4502-80ef-54706b8054f7))
(text "GPIO35-37 are used by the octal flash and PSRAM. GPIO47/48 are 1.8 V on the WROOM-2 and stay unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7f512284-203c-4bee-a3e3-d70367b16cb4))
(text "Controller test header (2x8): signals on odd pins, GND on every even pin." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c14181a-42ee-49c0-89cb-ef54bf7988ae))
